Z||000005||Tigger||07-04-2001||11:46 PM||||Got a picture of the ball joint?  I think it's possible to bolt it in upside down, I would bolt it in from the top like it should be when you replace them.||||reg||1
Z||000006||MontanaFiero||07-05-2001||01:53 AM||||Yeah, that's what they did, on both sides--They used a normal ball joint and put it flush with the under-side of the upper control arm. The "bulge" and nipple poked up through the hole and so did the bolts. I can't see any damage, but I will be using a straight edge tomorrow. It doesn't seem like it leaves much room for adjustment-- I bet alignment was a *itch.||||reg||1
